bonus to Cold, Sonic, and Electric Spell Power</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Wrist Boost</a> +1 or +3<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Wrist Boost</a> +1 or +3:</b> +1 or +3 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical</a> Resistance Ratings.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Legendary_Bracers_of_the_Glacier.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Legendary_Bracers_of_the_Glacier.png/420px-Legendary_Bracers_of_the_Glacier.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"537\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Legendary_Bracers_of_the_Glacier.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>Crafted by the great wizard Telios, these bracers are said to have been crafted from the flesh of Frost Giants. Telios disappeared recently, after being asked by members of the twelve to investigate the ruins beneath Stormreach. There is said to be a matching pair of gloves to these bracers.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816211735\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.093 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.153 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4177/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33323/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11281/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n102.36%  135.876     60 Template:IO\n100.00%  132.749      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  132.749      1 -total\n 97.42%  129.322      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 33.96%   45.085      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 33.12%   43.963      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 32.08%   42.590      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 31.39%   41.667      2 Template:InCategory\n 20.91%   27.754     10 Template:Popup\n 16.32%   21.661      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:82588-0!canonical and timestamp 20260816211735 and revision id 631877. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
